        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 European Foot and Ankle Society. Published by Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Müller-Weiss disease (MWD) is a complex idiopathic foot condition of the adult tarsal navicular characterised by progressive navicular fragmentation and talo-navicular joint destruction leading to mid and hind foot pain and deformit. This article reviews, the current literature regarding this condition and discusses the surgical treatment options."
